ationary Bubble with a lower Bubble Cost, good place to add weapons too.","tier":0},{"id":1501,"name":"Wiggle Cluster","pluralName":"Wiggle Clusters","shortName":"WC's","symbol":20,"gp":0,"bp":3,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"","summary":"Bubble Cluster (Decorative)","flavor":"A small bubble cluster that wiggles a little. Fancy eh?","tier":0},{"id":1502,"name":"Air Bladder Cluster","pluralName":"Air Bladders","shortName":"AB's","symbol":2445,"gp":0,"bp":5,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"","summary":"Bubble Cluster (Decorative)","flavor":"These bubbles fill up with air and then shoot it out! Now if only we knew what they are good for...","tier":0},{"id":1503,"name":"Tentacle Cluster","pluralName":"Tentacles","shortName":"TE's","symbol":2446,"gp":0,"bp":6,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"","summary":"Bubble Cluster (Decorative)","flavor":"It's a tentacle!  Eww.","tier":0},{"id":1504,"name":"Smooth Tentacle","pluralName":"Smooth Tentacles","shortName":"ST's","symbol":2447,"gp":0,"bp":7,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"","summary":"Bubble Cluster (Decorative)","flavor":"It's a bigger tentacle!  Eeeewwwww.  This one is less erratic.","tier":0},{"id":1505,"name":"Sliding Cluster","pluralName":"Sliding Clusters","shortName":"SC's","symbol":2448,"gp":0,"bp":3,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"","summary":"Bubble Cluster (Decorative)","flavor":"The sliding cluster allows for spikes, shifts, horns, all kinds of things really.","tier":0},{"id":2001,"name":"Basic Cannon","pluralName":"Basic Cannons","shortName":"BC's","symbol":729,"gp":1,"bp":1,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 1","summary":"Your standard weapon.","flavor":"The Basic Cannon is unwavering its determination to smite enemies.  It may not look like much, but it gets the job done.","tier":0},{"id":2002,"name":"Heavy Cannon","pluralName":"Heavy Cannons","shortName":"HC's","symbol":728,"gp":2,"bp":3,"classCost":2,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 3","summary":"Slower recharge rate but deals heavier damage.","flavor":"Please use responsibly.","tier":1},{"id":2003,"name":"Machine Gun","pluralName":"Machine Guns","shortName":"MG's","symbol":722,"gp":2,"bp":2,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 1","summary":"Fires bullets at twice the rate of the Basic Cannon.","flavor":"What's different about the machine gun that makes it fire faster, and where do these bubble bullets come from anyway?  The world may never know.","tier":1},{"id":2004,"name":"Super Machine Gun","pluralName":"Super Machine Guns","shortName":"SMG's","symbol":724,"gp":3,"bp":2,"classCost":3,"lower":true,"damageText":"Damage: 2","summary":"Twice the damage of a standard Machine Gun.","flavor":"The Super Machine Gun takes bubble machine guns to a whole new level.  Did we mention that it's super?","tier":2},{"id":2005,"name":"Dual Large MG","pluralName":"Dual Large MG's","shortName":"DLMG's","symbol":725,"gp":4,"bp":3,"classCost":4,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 3 per bullet","summary":"Fires 2 heavy bullets side by side at rapid speed.","flavor":"The Dual Large Machine Gun is so powerful that many people don't believe it even exists!  A weapon of legend, we think you'll like having it on your tank.","tier":4},{"id":2006,"name":"2 Parallel","pluralName":"2 Parallels","shortName":"2P's","symbol":734,"gp":2,"bp":3,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 1 per bullet","summary":"Fires 2 bullets side by side.","flavor":"The 2 Parallel is an awesome weapon with its 2 focused bullets.  Honestly, what CAN'T it do? \"Fire 3 bullets,\" says 3 Parallel.","tier":1},{"id":2007,"name":"3 Spread","pluralName":"3 Spreads","shortName":"3S's","symbol":733,"gp":2,"bp":3,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 1 per bullet","summary":"Fires 3 bullets in 3 directions.","flavor":"\"You know what's better than firing one bullet? Firing THREE bullets!\" says 3 Spread, despite the other weapons criticizing his lack of focus.  We'll let you be the judge.","tier":1},{"id":2008,"name":"5 Spread","pluralName":"5 Spreads","shortName":"5S's","symbol":732,"gp":3,"bp":3,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 2 per bullet","summary":"Fires 5 bullets in 5 directions.","flavor":"The 5 Spread makes aiming a thing of the past.  Just point anywhere and hold the mouse button, the screen will be filled with bullets going everywhere.","tier":2},{"id":2009,"name":"Pierce Cannon","pluralName":"Pierce Cannons","shortName":"PC's","symbol":717,"gp":3,"bp":2,"classCost":3,"lower":true,"damageText":"Damage: 5","summary":"Slow refire rate, but the bullets can pass through multiple enemies.","flavor":"Unstoppable AND unpoppable. 'Nuff said.","tier":5},{"id":2010,"name":"Exploding Pierce Cannon","pluralName":"Exploding Pierce Cannons","shortName":"EPC's","symbol":716,"gp":5,"bp":3,"classCost":2,"lower":true,"damageText":"Damage: 15","summary":"Fires bullets that pass through enemies, exploding on each impact.","flavor":"Making your bullets explode on impact seems like such a good idea, you'd wonder why every weapon didn't do it.","tier":6},{"id":2011,"name":"Leech Cannon","pluralName":"Leech Cannons","shortName":"LC's","symbol":723,"gp":4,"bp":2,"classCost":3,"lower":true,"damageText":"Damage: 2","summary":"Fires bullets that give you life whenever they damage the enemy.","flavor":"The Leech Cannon believes health points are something to be shared, mostly when those health points belong to other tanks.  He's so greedy.","tier":5},{"id":2012,"name":"Bullet Buster","pluralName":"Bullet Busters","shortName":"BB's","symbol":727,"gp":1,"bp":3,"classCost":4,"lower":false,"damageText":"Special: Deflects enemy bullets.","summary":"Enemy bullets stick to BB shells, allowing you to push them away from yourself.","flavor":"Bullet Buster is a lover, not a fighter.  Says Bullet Buster: \"We're just a bunch of bubbles anyways, what's with all the violence?\"","tier":3},{"id":2014,"name":"Mega Cannon","pluralName":"Mega Cannons","shortName":"MGC's","symbol":1895,"gp":1,"bp":3,"classCost":4,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 4","summary":"A Heavy Cannon designed for huge tanks.","flavor":"You must be 46 inches tall to use Mega Cannon.","tier":3},{"id":2015,"name":"Bubble Thrower","pluralName":"Bubble Throwers","shortName":"BT's","symbol":1944,"gp":4,"bp":2,"classCost":3,"lower":true,"damageText":"Damage: 1 per bullet","summary":"Throw streams of bubbles at your enemies.","flavor":"A flame thrower would be sweet, but it just wouldn't be practical for the current environment. In comes the Bubble Thrower, the flame thower's alternative for high-fluid environments.","tier":5},{"id":2016,"name":"Ricochet Gun","pluralName":"Ricochet Guns","shortName":"RG's","symbol":1947,"gp":4,"bp":3,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 8","summary":"Fires bullets that bounce around the bubble field.","flavor":"Other bullets give up when they miss, these guys bounce back and keep trying!","tier":3},{"id":2017,"name":"Beam Cannon","pluralName":"Beam Cannons","shortName":"BMC's","symbol":1993,"gp":4,"bp":3,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: Constant","summary":"Maintains a beam of energy as long as you hold the fire button.","flavor":"I'MA FIRIN MAH- No. Just no.","tier":4},{"id":2018,"name":"Repulsor Cannon","pluralName":"Repulsor Cannons","shortName":"RC's","symbol":2218,"gp":2,"bp":2,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Special: Pushes enemies away","summary":"Repels enemy tanks, killing them if they are pushed out of the bubblefield.","flavor":"Get away from me! GET AWAY!","tier":2},{"id":2022,"name":"3 Parallel","pluralName":"3 Parallels","shortName":"3P's","symbol":2402,"gp":3,"bp":3,"classCost":3,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 1 per bullet","summary":"Fires 3 bullets side by side.","flavor":"Actually does fire 3 bullet side by side. \"You son of a gun...\" says 2 Parallel","tier":2},{"id":3001,"name":"Sticky Burst","pluralName":"Sticky Bursts","shortName":"STB's","symbol":1805,"gp":2,"bp":3,"classCost":3,"lower":false,"damageText":"Special: Bullets slow enemies.","summary":"Fires a ring of sticky bullets.","flavor":"Sticky bubbles?  I guess it makes more sense than bubbles that explode on impact.  And this gun makes LOTS of sticky bubbles.","tier":2},{"id":3002,"name":"Stun Burst","pluralName":"Stun Bursts","shortName":"SUB's","symbol":714,"gp":2,"bp":4,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Special: Stuns units for 2 seconds.","summary":"Nearby enemies are stunned and cannot move or attack.","flavor":"Do Bubble Tanks have brains?  Maybe they have drivers?  Not sure, but somehow this weapon is able to stun those tanks really well.","tier":3},{"id":3003,"name":"Area Burst","pluralName":"Area Bursts","shortName":"AB's","symbol":731,"gp":3,"bp":3,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Area Damage: 25","summary":"Deals damage to surrounding tanks.","flavor":"For those who want an up close and personal battle and are looking for that more intimate fighting, the Area Burst is for you.  Just fly into a group of enemies and let loose.","tier":4},{"id":3004,"name":"Area Burst Cannon","pluralName":"Area Bursts","shortName":"ABC's","symbol":730,"gp":4,"bp":3,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 50 / 30","summary":"Fires bullets that explode, dealing damage to an area.","flavor":"You don't need to have really good aim to hit enemies with the Area Burst Cannon.  Just aim for the general vicinity.","tier":5},{"id":3005,"name":"Star Burst","pluralName":"Star Bursts","shortName":"SB's","symbol":715,"gp":3,"bp":3,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 15 at first, then 5 per pierce bullet.","summary":"A powerful bullet that explodes, releasing a ring of piercing bullets.","flavor":"It's so pretty...","tier":5},{"id":3006,"name":"Drone Converter","pluralName":"Drone Converters","shortName":"DC's","symbol":726,"gp":4,"bp":5,"classCost":4,"lower":false,"damageText":"Special: Converts all drones","summary":"Puts all enemy drones under your control.","flavor":"Something about the Drone Converter just makes enemy drones want to die for you instead of their past master.  Not sure why they feel the need to kamikaze in the first place.","tier":6},{"id":3007,"name":"Ally Bay: Swarm","pluralName":"Ally Bays: Swarm","shortName":"AB:S's","symbol":712,"gp":2,"bp":1,"classCost":4,"lower":false,"damageText":"Ally Stats: 15 HP, 1 Damage per shot.","summary":"Spawns allies that will fight for you.","flavor":"You know what's more fun than blowing up tanks by yourself?  Blowing them up with friends!  And with the Ally Bay, you can buy some friends! You'll be so popular!","tier":3},{"id":3008,"name":"Massive Cannon","pluralName":"Massive Cannons","shortName":"MC's","symbol":721,"gp":3,"bp":3,"classCost":5,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 100","summary":"A massive weapon that can obliterate enemies.","flavor":"This is the gun all other Bubble Tanks weapons aspire to be.","tier":4},{"id":3009,"name":"Seekers","pluralName":"Seekers","shortName":"SC's","symbol":1825,"gp":2,"bp":2,"classCost":3,"lower":true,"damageText":"Damage: 10","summary":"Fires seekers which hunt enemies.","flavor":"These little guys can smell your fear.","tier":2},{"id":3010,"name":"Shield","pluralName":"Shield","shortName":"SD's","symbol":1823,"gp":2,"bp":2,"classCost":0,"lower":true,"damageText":"Special: Brief invulnerability.","summary":"Allows you to become invincible for a short time.","flavor":"Ha ha! You can't hit me!","tier":2},{"id":3011,"name":"Teleport Before","pluralName":"Teleport Befores","shortName":"TPB's","symbol":1821,"gp":3,"bp":2,"classCost":3,"lower":true,"damageText":"Special: Teleports","summary":"Teleports to mouse location before executing weapon fires.","flavor":"The Teleport Before jumps the gun and gets things done.","tier":4},{"id":3012,"name":"Teleport After","pluralName":"Teleport Afters","shortName":"TPA's","symbol":1829,"gp":3,"bp":2,"classCost":3,"lower":true,"damageText":"Special: Teleports","summary":"Teleports to mouse location after executing weapon fires.","flavor":"The Teleport After allows all other secondary weapons to finish their business before making the leap.  It's rude to interrupt.","tier":4},{"id":3013,"name":"Doomsday Infector","pluralName":"Doomsday Infectors","shortName":"DDI's","symbol":32,"gp":4,"bp":3,"classCost":4,"lower":true,"damageText":"Damage: 1/sec/Seeker","summary":"Infects enemies, dealing damage over time. Infected enemies spawn 2 more Infectors upon death.","flavor":"This weapon breaks every biological warfare treaty ever written.","tier":6},{"id":3014,"name":"Bubble Whip","pluralName":"Bubble Whips","shortName":"BW's","symbol":2037,"gp":4,"bp":2,"classCost":2,"lower":true,"damageText":"Damage: 30","summary":"Short-range, 360 degree attack.","flavor":"Now you can whip the enemy tanks literally AND figuratively!","tier":5},{"id":3015,"name":"Rocket Launcher","pluralName":"Rocket Launchers","shortName":"RL's","symbol":2179,"gp":3,"bp":2,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 4 per Rocket","summary":"Fires ten rockets.","flavor":"Psew! Psew! PsewPsewPsew! WHOOSH... KA-BOOOOM!","tier":3},{"id":3016,"name":"Ally Bay: Mine Layer","pluralName":"Ally Bays: Mine Layer","shortName":"AB:ML's","symbol":2183,"gp":3,"bp":1,"classCost":4,"lower":false,"damageText":"Ally Stats: 15 HP, 3 Damage per mine.","summary":"Spawns allies that will lay mines for you.","flavor":"Laying mines is a very tedious task. That's why you should convince your friends to do it for you! Just make sure they tell you where they put them.","tier":3},{"id":3017,"name":"Apocalypse Cannon","pluralName":"Apocalypse Cannons","shortName":"AC's","symbol":2039,"gp":9,"bp":6,"classCost":6,"lower":false,"damageText":"Special: Destroys the Bubblefield","summary":"Fires a bullet that destroys the Bubblefield when it reaches the boundary.","flavor":"Your enemies better inform everyone they know of their impending doom when this gun is fired.","tier":6},{"id":5001,"name"