weapon.","flavor":"This is the standard gun on most bad guys. Looks simple, but when facing a few enemies with this weapon it can get tough quick.","tier":0},{"id":4002,"name":"Seekers","pluralName":"Seekers","shortName":"S's","symbol":702,"gp":2,"bp":3,"classCost":2,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 2","summary":"Emits drones which will seek out the target and explode upon impact.","flavor":"Bubblefields don't offer many good hiding places.  If you're still alive, seekers will find you to put an end to that.","tier":0},{"id":4003,"name":"Enemy Spawner","pluralName":"EnemySpawners","shortName":"ES's","symbol":704,"gp":3,"bp":8,"classCost":3,"lower":false,"damageText":"Special: Spawns enemies.","summary":"Creates small fighter enemies.","flavor":"Taking up the family business of attacking tanks is fine and good, but Enemy Spawner would love to have at least one kid be a doctor.","tier":0},{"id":4004,"name":"3 Spread","pluralName":"3 Spreads","shortName":"3S's","symbol":706,"gp":3,"bp":3,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 2 per bullet","summary":"Fires 3 bullets in 3 directions.","flavor":"Getting away from 3 Spread can be difficult.  Me?  I've moved out of town and changed my name.  You can't ever be too safe.","tier":0},{"id":4005,"name":"3 Parallel","pluralName":"3 Parallels","shortName":"3P's","symbol":705,"gp":3,"bp":2,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 1 per bullet","summary":"Fires 3 bullets side by side.","flavor":"This weapon is great for kids not ready for the 5 Parallel experience yet.","tier":0},{"id":4006,"name":"5 Parallel","pluralName":"5 Parallels","shortName":"5P's","symbol":707,"gp":4,"bp":3,"classCost":2,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 1 per bullet","summary":"Fires 5 bullets side by side.","flavor":"It took 7 Hero Interactive interns to decide that gluing 5 basic cannons side by side was going to be awesome.","tier":0},{"id":4007,"name":"5 Spread","pluralName":"5 Spreads","shortName":"5S's","symbol":708,"gp":6,"bp":3,"classCost":2,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 2 per bullet","summary":"Fires 5 bullets in 5 directions.","flavor":"Some critics wonder why we never went further to create the 7 Spread. You're looking into the future, but I'm afrad the technology for 7 Spread simply doesn't exist yet.","tier":0},{"id":4008,"name":"360 Spread","pluralName":"360 Spreads","shortName":"360S's","symbol":709,"gp":4,"bp":4,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 2 per bullet","summary":"Fires bullets in 360 degrees.","flavor":"Don't hate on the 360's general lack of aiming skill. 4 out of 5 dentists agree: this gun is going to hit you.","tier":0},{"id":4009,"name":"Mine Dropper","pluralName":"Mine Droppers","shortName":"MD's","symbol":691,"gp":1,"bp":5,"classCost":2,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 10","summary":"Drops immobile mines.","flavor":"Most bullets are wasted when they miss their target. Mines have decided to wait, sit still, and contemplate their existence until you hit them.","tier":0},{"id":4010,"name":"Orbital Seeker","pluralName":"Orbital Seekers","shortName":"OS's","symbol":690,"gp":6,"bp":2,"classCost":3,"lower":true,"damageText":"Damage: 1 per Seeker","summary":"Spawns orbiting seeker missles around the enemy.","flavor":"Round and round they go, what they'll hit knowbody knows. Says Orbital Seeker: \"We'll just hang here should you need us.\"","tier":0},{"id":4011,"name":"Sticky Gun","pluralName":"Sticky Guns","shortName":"SG's","symbol":692,"gp":2,"bp":3,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Special: Slows target.","summary":"Fires sticky bullets which briefly slow down the player's tank.","flavor":"What makes these bullets so sticky?  You don't wanna know.","tier":0},{"id":4012,"name":"Sapper Drone","pluralName":"Sapper Drones","shortName":"SD's","symbol":693,"gp":4,"bp":5,"classCost":3,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 3 / 2","summary":"These drones seek out the player's tank, damage it, then return a portion of life to their creator.","flavor":"The neighborhood has really gotten rough since Sapper Drones came to town. Says the Sapper: \"Hey your life looks good. Can I hold it?\"","tier":0},{"id":4013,"name":"Seeker Carrier","pluralName":"Seeker Carriers","shortName":"SC's","symbol":696,"gp":1,"bp":4,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 2 per Drone (6 Drones)","summary":"Pops and releases Seeker Drones when shot by player.","flavor":"We've always wondered what sort of dark little secrets were inside of those big yellow bubbles. \"Shoot it.  You know you want to.\" says the Carrier.","tier":0},{"id":4015,"name":"Rotating Machine Gun","pluralName":"Rotating Machine Guns","shortName":"RMG's","symbol":701,"gp":7,"bp":5,"classCost":2,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 4 per bullet","summary":"Shoots many powerful bullets in a circle.","flavor":"Don't mock the fact that this weapon freaks out and shoots everywhere, this is the gun that makes many BT3 players break down and cry.","tier":0},{"id":4016,"name":"Heavy Cannon","pluralName":"Heavy Cannons","shortName":"HC's","symbol":1719,"gp":2,"bp":3,"classCost":2,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 4","summary":"Fires bigger, slower, more damaging bullets.","flavor":"Making more destructive bubble weapons is a careful and precise science few can comprehend.  This gun shoots bigger bullets!","tier":0},{"id":4017,"name":"Machine Gun","pluralName":"Machine Guns","shortName":"MG's","symbol":25,"gp":6,"bp":2,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 2 per bullet","summary":"Fires many bullets in rapid succession.","flavor":"The Machine Gun just realized that if you keep holding down the trigger, the bullets keep flying out.  I hope he keeps this secret to himself.","tier":0},{"id":4018,"name":"Ink Gun","pluralName":"Ink Guns","shortName":"IG's","symbol":44,"gp":2,"bp":3,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Special: Inks player's screen","summary":"Fires ink bullets that temporarily obstruct the player's view.","flavor":"This gun took a few lessons from its friend, the squid.","tier":0},{"id":4019,"name":"Spin-Fire","pluralName":"Spin-Fires","shortName":"SPN's","symbol":2214,"gp":8,"bp":3,"classCost":3,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: lg bullet: 3, sm bullet: 1","summary":"Fires one large bullet that then fires lots of smaller bullets.","flavor":"This bullet parts the seas with destruction!","tier":0},{"id":4020,"name":"Rocket Launcher","pluralName":"Rocket Launchers","shortName":"RL's","symbol":2180,"gp":3,"bp":2,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 3 per Rocket","summary":"Fires ten rockets.","flavor":"You might be able to dodge nine rockets, but ten? Psshhhh.","tier":0},{"id":4021,"name":"Seeker Mine Dropper","pluralName":"Seeker Mine Droppers","shortName":"SMD's","symbol":2181,"gp":2,"bp":5,"classCost":3,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 6","summary":"Drops camouflaged mines that gravitate toward the player's tank when it gets near.","flavor":"If the regular mines had the right idea, these things are the Einsteins of the bullet world.","tier":0},{"id":4022,"name":"Seeker Mine Pod","pluralName":"Seeker Mine Pods","shortName":"SMP's","symbol":35,"gp":1,"bp":5,"classCost":3,"lower":true,"damageText":"Damage: 6","summary":"When tank is destroyed, spawns camouflaged mines that gravitate toward the player's tank when it gets near.","flavor":"If the regular mines had the right idea, these things are the Einsteins of the bullet world.","tier":0},{"id":4023,"name":"Neutralizer","pluralName":"Neutralizers","shortName":"NZ's","symbol":2215,"gp":6,"bp":4,"classCost":5,"lower":false,"damageText":"Special: Neutralizes AC Bullet","summary":"If an Apocalypse Cannon is fired, this weapon will emit a blast that neutralizes its effect.","flavor":"It's like the antacid of the bubblefield world.","tier":0},{"id":4024,"name":"Ripple Generator","pluralName":"Ripple Generators","shortName":"RPL's","symbol":2219,"gp":2,"bp":2,"classCost":3,"lower":true,"damageText":"Special: Repels nearby tanks","summary":"Pushes tanks away. The smaller the tank the further they go.","flavor":"This is my bubble field! You get outta here!","tier":0},{"id":4025,"name":"Jamming Gun","pluralName":"Jamming Guns","shortName":"JG's","symbol":2227,"gp":2,"bp":3,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Special: Jams target's weapons.","summary":"Fires jamming bullets that briefly prevent the player's tank from firing its weapons.","flavor":"Haha, look at them stare at you in confusion as they try to keep firing.","tier":0},{"id":4026,"name":"Spike","pluralName":"Spikes","shortName":"SPK's","symbol":2229,"gp":2,"bp":3,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 3","summary":"Damages and knocks back any opposing tank that collides with it.","flavor":"Can't touch this. Well, actually you can, but we don't recommend it.","tier":0},{"id":4032,"name":"Shield Turrets","pluralName":"Shield Turrets","shortName":"ShT's","symbol":2451,"gp":3,"bp":3,"classCost":3,"lower":false,"damageText":"Special: Builds Shield Generators","summary":"Builds turrets that protect the tank from damage.","flavor":"\"Haha, you can't hurt- HEY! DON'T TOUCH THAT!!\"","tier":0},{"id":6001,"name":"Aggressor","pluralName":"Aggressors","shortName":"AG's","symbol":2000,"gp":0,"bp":2,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Behavior: Aggressive","summary":"Causes the enemy to seek out the player's Bubble Tank.","flavor":"CHAAAAARRRRRGGEE!!","tier":0},{"id":6002,"name":"Healer","pluralName":"Healers","shortName":"H's","symbol":2001,"gp":2,"bp":2,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Behavior: Heals other enemies","summary":"Allows the enemy to heal other enemies.","flavor":"MEDIC!","tier":0},{"id":6003,"name":"Skittish","pluralName":"Skittishes","shortName":"SK's","symbol":43,"gp":0,"bp":2,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Behavior: Skittish","summary":"Causes the enemy to avoid the player's Bubble Tank.","flavor":"Fear? Or strategy? You decide.","tier":0},{"id":6004,"name":"Phasing","pluralName":"Phasings","shortName":"PH's","symbol":2222,"gp":2,"bp":2,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Behavior: Tank phases in and out","summary":"Causes the enemy to alternate between visible and invisible.","flavor":"Now you see him, now you don't! Oh wait, there he is.","tier":0},{"id":6005,"name":"Wall Flower","pluralName":"Wall Flowers","shortName":"WF's","symbol":2230,"gp":0,"bp":2,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Behavior: Circles Bubblefield","summary":"The tank will circle the edge of the bubblefield.","flavor":"You make me dizzy...","tier":0},{"id":7001,"name":"Ally Auto Cannon","pluralName":"Ally Auto Cannons","shortName":"AAC's","symbol":2255,"gp":1,"bp":1,"classCost":0,"lower":false,"damageText":"Damage: 1","summary":"Basic Cannon that auto targets and fires.","flavor":"If you want something done right, let another gun do it.","tier":0}]
